-strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span>, hence the order of the pattern.\n\nThe argument is carried out for the graph classes of the archive and\ntheir monadic dependence, and transferred to the graph classes used\nhere."},"s:Lax185574.ForbiddenPhiPsiPatterns.forbidden_phiPsi_patterns":{"href":"../lax-185574/Lax185574.ForbiddenPhiPsiPatterns.html#s-Lax185574.ForbiddenPhiPsiPatterns.forbidden_phiPsi_patterns","incident":["e:Lax185574Proofs.ForbiddenPhiPsiPatterns.forbidden_phiPsi_patterns:conclusion:Lax185574.ForbiddenPhiPsiPatterns.forbidden_phiPsi_patterns:0"],"kind":"statement","label":"Monadically dependent classes exclude large (φ, ψ)-patterns","nodeId":"s:Lax185574.ForbiddenPhiPsiPatterns.forbidden_phiPsi_patterns","semanticId":"Lax185574.ForbiddenPhiPsiPatterns.forbidden_phiPsi_patterns","tooltipHtml":"Monadically dependent classes exclude large (φ, ψ)-patterns"}}},"status":"1 statement; 1 proof","svg":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"prepared-graph\" width=\"387\" height=\"242\" viewBox=\"0 0 387 242\" aria-label=\"Proof dependency graph\" data-layout-digest=\"2bee82bd59d091d454153600fe52beb154092a288fa43a86f924a25ba666cedb\"><defs><marker id=\"graph-arrow-proof-network-2bee82bd59d091d4-statements:Lax185574.ForbiddenPhiPsiPatterns\" viewBox=\"0 -5 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"0\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" markerUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" orient=\"auto\" overflow=\"visible\"><path d=\"M1,-4.25 L9,0 L1,4.25 Q3,0 1,-4.25 Z\"/></marker></defs><g data-graph-camera><path class=\"graph-edge-hit\" data-edge-hit=\"e:Lax185574Proofs.ForbiddenPhiPsiPatterns.forbidden_phiPsi_patterns:assumption:Lax185574.BipartiteHomogeneity:0\" d=\"M104.101,187.394 L104.101,135.798\"/><path class=\"graph-edge-hit\" data-edge-hit=\"e:Lax185574Proofs.ForbiddenPhiPsiPatterns.forbidden_phiPsi_patterns:assumption:Lax185574.IndependenceProperty:0\" d=\"M281.496,187.394 L28